Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 17:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/25] Export and import the configuration as one JSON
 document
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The database holds listings, outbox rows and sessions, none of which you
would carry to another machine. What you would carry is the part you typed:
searches with their filters, destinations with their settings, and which
search feeds which destination. `vinted-sniper export` prints that as JSON,
`vinted-sniper import file.json` merges it back — additively, matched by
search URL and destination name, so importing the same file twice changes
nothing. The same is available at /api/export and /api/import, and the
dashboard links the download.
